    "body": "Yeah same, but I've already done a lot of yak shaving on this particular feature. If you have thoughts on what uniform behavior should be I'm happy to take that into account of course. It sounds like you'd prefer Infra value type checking over IDL dictionary conversion which seems like a reasonable enough change, even though it introduces a fair bit of redundancy.",
